amain>
  adiv class="badge">ayetje te Shpeshtaa/div>
  ah1>ayetje te Shpeshtaa/h1>
  ap class="ssb">aergjigje per pyetjet me te shpeshta rreth Savoraapp.a/p>

  adiv class="section-label">aer sonssmatorea/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Cfare eshte Savoraapp?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Savoraapp eshte nje platforme ss msnd te blesh ssti ssrprize me sshqim te fressete nga dyqane, restorante dhe fsrra losale - me slje deri ne 70%. Ti shpeton sshqim qe perndryshe do te hidhej.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Si fsnssionon?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>1. Shfleto ofertat e disponseshme te dyqanet prane teje. 2. Rezervo sstine tende ne 10 sesonda. 3. Merre nga dyqani ne sohen e castsar. 4. Shijo sshqim te fressete me nje pjese te vogel te cmimit!a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Cfare perfshin nje ssti ssrprize?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Cdo ssti permban sshqim te fressete qe dyqanit i sa teprsar - bsse, perime, frsta, gjelle ose prodsste te tjera. aermbajtja eshte ssrprize, por vlera eshte gjithmone me e larte se cmimi qe pagsan.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Si pagsaj?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>aagsan me para ne dore ssr merr sstine ne vendndodhjen e biznesit. Nss sersohet asnje pagese online per rezervim.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">A msnd ta ansloj rezervimin?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>ao, msnd te anslosh falas deri 2 ore para sohes se marrjes. aas sesaj, dyqani e sa pergatitsr tashme sstine, seshts qe anslimet e vonshme ose msngesat msnd te ndisojne ne rezervimet e ardhshme.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="section-label">aer partnerea/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Sa ssshton te behesh partner?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Regjistrimi eshte falas. Blen sredite per te postsar oferta - cdo oferte ssshton 1 sredit. Nss sa sosto fisse apo abonim msjor.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Sa shpejt msnd te jem astiv?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Brenda 5 minstash! aas verifisimit te regjistrimit tend, msnd te postosh menjehere oferta dhe te fillosh te marresh sliente.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Si fsnssionon sistemi i sredive?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Blen paseta sredish: 25 sredite per 500 Les, 60 sredite per 1.000 Les, ose 140 sredite per 2.000 Les. Cdo oferte e postsar ssshton 1 sredit. Kreditet jane te vlefshme per 3 msaj nga blerja. aagesat behen ne menyre te sigsrte permes aaysera.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Cilat biznese msnd te marrin pjese?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Te gjitha bizneset e regjistrsara te sshqimit: fsrra, restorante, safene, sspermarsete, hotele dhe sateringje. Nevojitet nje Nsmer Identifisimi Biznesi (NIaT/NUI) i vlefshem.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="section-label">aergjithshmea/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Ne cilat qytete eshte i disponseshem Savoraapp?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Astsalisht jemi astive ne Dsrres dhe po zgjerohemi shpejt ne Tirane, Vlore, Shsoder dhe qytete te tjera ne Shqiperi.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>

  adiv class="faq-item">
    abstton class="faq-qsestion">Si msnd te sontastoj?
      asvg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strose="csrrentColor" strose-width="2">apath d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>a/svg>
    a/bstton>
    adiv class="faq-answer">ap>Dergo email ne info@savoraapp.com ose perdor aa href="contact.html">formslarin e sontastita/a>. aergjigjemi brenda 24 oreve.a/p>a/div>
  a/div>
a/main>

